1
00:01:20,601 --> 00:01:25,128
<v JACINTA> Hello, Easy Life Cleaning Services, Jacinta speaking.

2
00:01:25,138 --> 00:01:30,968
<v CLIENT> Oh hello. I'm looking for a cleaning service for my apartment - do you do domestic cleaning?

3
00:01:30,978 --> 00:01:31,639
<v JACINTA> Sure.

4
00:01:31,649 --> 00:01:34,529
<v CLIENT> Well, it's just a one-bedroom flat.

5
00:01:34,539 --> 00:01:37,197
<v CLIENT> Do you have a basic cleaning package?

6
00:01:37,207 --> 00:01:43,411
<v JACINTA> Yes. For a one-bedroom flat we're probably looking at about two hours for a clean.

7
00:01:43,421 --> 00:01:48,970
<v JACINTA> So we'd do a thorough clean of all surfaces in each room, and polish them where necessary.

8
00:01:48,980 --> 00:01:51,421
<v JACINTA> Does your apartment have carpets?

9
00:01:51,431 --> 00:01:55,024
<v CLIENT> No, I don't have any, but the floor would need cleaning.

10
00:01:55,034 --> 00:01:57,920
<v JACINTA> Of course - we'd do that in every room.

11
00:01:57,930 --> 00:02:01,050
<v JACINTA> And we'd do a thorough clean of the kitchen and bathroom.

12
00:02:01,060 --> 00:02:01,803
<v CLIENT> OK.

13
00:02:01,813 --> 00:02:10,462
<v JACINTA> Then we have some additional services which you can request if you want - So for example, we can clean your oven for you every week.

14
00:02:10,472 --> 00:02:14,925
<v CLIENT> Actually, I hardly ever use that, but can you do the fridge?

15
00:02:14,935 --> 00:02:17,649
<v JACINTA> Sure. Would you like that done every week?

16
00:02:17,659 --> 00:02:23,536
<v CLIENT> Yes, definitely. And would ironing clothes be an additional service you can do?

17
00:02:23,546 --> 00:02:24,814
<v JACINTA> Yes, of course.

18
00:02:24,824 --> 00:02:28,394
<v CLIENT> It wouldn't be much, just my shirts for work that week.

19
00:02:28,404 --> 00:02:32,522
<v JACINTA> That's fine. And we could also clean your microwave if you want.

20
00:02:32,532 --> 00:02:36,689
<v CLIENT> No, I wipe that out pretty regularly so there's no need for that.

21
00:02:36,699 --> 00:02:43,098
<v JACINTA> We also offer additional services that you might want a bit less often, say every month.

22
00:02:43,108 --> 00:02:47,653
<v JACINTA> So for example, if the inside of your windows need cleaning, we could do that.

23
00:02:47,663 --> 00:02:49,283
<v CLIENT> Yes, that'd be good.

24
00:02:49,293 --> 00:02:57,114
<v CLIENT> I'm on the fifteenth floor, so the outside gets done regularly by specialists, but the inside does get a bit grubby.

25
00:02:57,124 --> 00:03:00,676
<v JACINTA> And we could arrange for your curtains to get cleaned if necessary.

26
00:03:00,686 --> 00:03:02,155
<v CLIENT> No, they're OK.

27
00:03:02,165 --> 00:03:05,546
<v CLIENT> But would you be able to do something about the balcony?

28
00:03:05,556 --> 00:03:11,424
<v CLIENT> It's quite small and I don't use it much, but it could do with a wash every month or so.

29
00:03:11,434 --> 00:03:14,086
<v JACINTA> Yes, we can get the pressure washer onto that.

30
00:03:54,394 --> 00:04:00,966
<v JACINTA> Now if you're interested, we do offer some other possibilities to do with general maintenance.

31
00:04:00,977 --> 00:04:10,318
<v JACINTA> For example, if you have a problem with water and you need a plumber in a hurry, we can put you in touch with a reliable one who can come out straightaway.

32
00:04:10,328 --> 00:04:13,150
<v JACINTA> And the same thing if you need an electrician.

33
00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:15,151
<v CLIENT> Right. That's good to know.

34
00:04:15,161 --> 00:04:19,891
<v CLIENT> I've only just moved here so I don't have any of those sorts of contacts.

35
00:04:19,901 --> 00:04:33,749
<v JACINTA> And I don't know if this is of interest to you, but we also offer a special vacuum cleaning system which can improve the indoor air quality of your home by capturing up to 99% of all the dust in the air.

36
00:04:33,759 --> 00:04:37,648
<v JACINTA> So if you're troubled by allergies, this can make a big difference.

37
00:04:37,658 --> 00:04:42,195
<v CLIENT> Right. In fact, I don't have that sort of problem, but I'll bear it in mind.

38
00:04:42,205 --> 00:04:45,734
<v CLIENT> Now can you tell me a bit about your cleaning staff?

39
00:04:45,744 --> 00:04:50,356
<v JACINTA> Of course. So all our cleaners are very carefully selected.

40
00:04:50,366 --> 00:05:01,380
<v JACINTA> When they apply to us, they have to undergo a security check with the police to make sure they don't have any sort of criminal background, and, of course, they have to provide references as well.

41
00:05:01,390 --> 00:05:06,150
<v JACINTA> Then if we think they might be suitable for the job, we give them training for it.

42
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:11,578
<v JACINTA> That lasts for two weeks so it's very thorough, and at the end of it, they have a test.

43
00:05:11,588 --> 00:05:23,119
<v JACINTA> If they pass that, we take them on, but we monitor them very carefully - we ask all our clients to complete a review of their performance after every visit and to email it to us.

44
00:05:23,129 --> 00:05:26,597
<v JACINTA> So we can pick up any problems straightaway and deal with them.

45
00:05:26,607 --> 00:05:29,330
<v CLIENT> OK, well that all sounds good.

46
00:05:29,340 --> 00:05:32,500
<v CLIENT> And will I always have the same cleaner?

47
00:05:32,510 --> 00:05:37,297
<v JACINTA> Yes, we do our best to organise it that way, and we usually manage it.

48
00:05:37,307 --> 00:05:41,965
<v CLIENT> Good. That's fine. Right, so I'd like to go ahead and …